    name: Simple Loop
    category: Built-in
    description: A system that loops infinitely and spawns a stream of particles
      in an upward direction, which is affected by gravity. It’s a good starting
      point for continuous streams and can be adjusted to create effects such as
      smoke stacks, rain, waterfalls, etc.
